<section class="section why" id="why" data-screen-label="Why Alchemystical">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="reveal"><div class="eyebrow">Why Alchemystical</div></div>

    <p class="why-para left reveal" data-d="1">
      Alchemystical lives in the meeting of things usually kept apart. We bring together two decades of experience
      across newsrooms, policy spaces, and academic research in one collaborative space. The best work happens when
      rigorous research, creative media, and policy thinking are not treated as silos.
    </p>

    <p class="why-para right reveal" data-d="2">
      Our perspective is shaped by a richly international background and ethos. We root each project in its own
      cultures and contexts rather than a single vantage point, attentive to plural histories and to the values our
      clients hold close. Rather than flattening difference into a template, we stay close to where each story and
      community actually stands. Preeti works alongside a trusted network of researchers and designers across the
      globe.
    </p>

    <p class="why-para left reveal" data-d="3">
      At the centre of everything is the lived experience of people and the dignity of their voice. That commitment
      is the lens we begin from, not a method we apply afterwards, and it runs through every piece of research,
      media, and policy thinking we take on.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
